// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4-7_Mortimer_Kal_SF_Tip 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - KidnapFionaKalClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1591082242" "Mortimer Kal's Daughter"
// DetailString :
"P1803555958" "You snatched young Fiona from the hands of the Circle of Thorns mere moments before they snuffed out her soul and used her body and blood as a weapon against her wizard father. For saving her life, Fiona and her father will forever be indebted to you. But instead of letting her go free your plan was to kidnap the woman in order to gain leverage over her father. For that you may never be forgiven by the Kal family.<br><br>With Fiona safely stored away back at your lair it was now time to find Mortimer on Sharkhead Isle. Fiona's kidnapping was just the first step in your plan to gain Incarnate power, and Mortimer Kal was going to help you do it.<br><br>There is one surprising turn of events in all of this. As much as Fiona might hate you, she hates her estranged father even more. Perhaps when Incarnate power is yours, and Mortimer has outlived his usefulness, Fiona could take his place. As the innocent daughter of the all-powerful wizard she will prove to be... <b>The Wizard's Weakness</b>."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - FionaDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3873146795" "Thanks for rescuing me, {HeroName}... I think. I thought you were seriously bad news though."
// Answer Text :
"P3981723578" "Rescue you? No, I'm here to kidnap you myself."
// Answer Text :
"P3231546283" "I AM bad news. You could scream, but nobody is alive to hear you."
// Answer Text :
"P4086673749" "It would be best if you came along quietly."
// Page KidnapPage1 Text :
"P1118612436" "<color orange>Fiona's eyes widen as she realizes that you are serious.</color><br><br>"What? Why? Why is everyone after <i>me</i> all of a sudden?""
// Answer Text :
"P2027818106" "The Circle would have sacrificed you, I just need you as leverage."
// Page KidnapPage2 Text :
"P3242849543" "<color orange>Fiona quirks a brow.</color><br><br>"Leverage? For what?""
// Answer Text :
"P2338083158" "Leverage over your father. Cooperate and you'll get to see him again."
// Page KidnapPage3 Text :
"P3540764533" "<color orange>Fiona rolls her eyes and throws her hands up.</color><br><br>"First he leaves mom and I, and now what? He owes you money or something? Way to go dad, you deadbeat.""
// Answer Text :
"P1552739605" "Money, no. Deadbeat, maybe. Powerful wizard, definitely."
// Page KidnapPage4 Text :
"P770249543" "<color orange>Fiona blinks.</color><br><br>"Wizard? What are you talking about? Is this some sort of sick joke? Is dad here? Dad?! Get out here and show yourself, coward...""
// Answer Text :
"P371768006" ""I don't have time for daddy issues." (Knock Fiona out)"
// Page KidnapPage5 Text :
"P2043020241" "<color orange>Fiona's eyes roll back in her head and she collapses like a sack of potatoes.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P395101726" "Take Fiona and Leave."
// Page BadNewsPage1 Text :
"P3902173879" "<color orange>Fiona's eyes widen in terror and she opens her mouth to scream, but all that comes out is a pathetic little squeak. She faints on the spot.</color>"
// Page QuietlyPage1 Text :
"P2739968311" "Quietly? Where are you taking me?"
// Answer Text :
"P1190748812" "Somewhere safe where your father cannot find you."
// Page QuietlyPage2 Text :
"P135440153" "<color orange>Fiona laughs cynically.</color><br><br>"Good one."<br><br>"Listen, as far as I can tell, my <i>father</i> isn't even looking for me. I don't need to go anywhere special for him to keep forgetting I even exist.""
// Answer Text :
"P2141854989" "Oh, I assure you, he'll come looking for you soon."
// Page QuietlyPage3 Text :
"P3546330898" "<color orange>Fiona eyes you tepidly and she bites her lower lip.</color><br><br>"Why are you so interested in him not finding me?""
// Answer Text :
"P2133796303" "Because we both want something from him."
// Page QuietlyPage4 Text :
"P2459374028" "<color orange>Fiona rolls her eyes again.</color><br><br>"I'm not so sure about that... but I'll come with you, if just to inconvenience him.""
// Answer Text :
"P1234662300" "Leave with Fiona"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MortimerKalDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Midnighter Text :
"P2276631610" "<color orange>Mortimer Kal nods to you in recognition.</color orange><br><br>"A fellow Midnighter, hmmm? I'm afraid I don't have much time to talk with you, I have many <i>things</i> which require my full attention...<br><br> Important things...""
// Answer Text :
"P2981263512" "Like discussing your daughter's whereabouts?"
// Page MidnighterKidnap1 Text :
"P1000613014" "<color orange>Mortimer Kal furrows his troubled brow and narrows his eyes upon you.</color><br><br>"You would <i>dare</i> such villainy? Against a fellow Midnighter?!""
// Answer Text :
"P2282045671" "Relax, I just needed to ensure your cooperation."
// Page MidnighterKidnap2 Text :
"P644629944" "<color orange>Mortimer keeps his steely eyes locked on you and then looks away over the water.</color><br><br>"You obviously hold all of the cards here, {HeroName}, so we'll play your game, for now.<br><br>How may I be of <i>assistance</i>?""
// Answer Text :
"P639662907" "Explain your desire for Incarnate power."
// Page MidnighterKidnap3 Text :
"P3702250470" "<color orange>Mortimer nods as you explain your quest to gain Incarnate power.</color><br><br>"I know of a way, but this is no easy path you set out upon. You were wise to seek my help to secure this power you seek. I will help you, all I ask for in return is my daughter safely returned to me and to never be bothered by you again.""
// Answer Text :
"P1854338679" "First, the information, then you'll get your daughter back."
// Page MidnighterKidnap4 Text :
"P3498478232" "<color orange>Mortimer's eyes smile at your shrewd dealing, impressed but displeased that you remember you have the negotiating advantage here.</color><br><br>"Very well. Though I cannot trust you I would have you know that you <i>can</i> trust me. I hope that that truth is enough to see the safe return of my daughter.<br><br>But I warn you. If she is not, then I <i>WILL</i> see you in hell. That you can count on, {HeroName}.<br><br>The power you seek is the <color deepskyblue>Flames of Prometheus</color>. The legendary fire gifted upon man to grant him the power of reasoning, the power to defy the will of the gods themselves, and the super powers that make you the terror you are today. It is a spark of divinity itself, and it is in the hands of a man who embodies everything the flame stands for; man's triumph over the universe around him.""
// Answer Text :
"P3099003887" "I'm not in the mood for riddles, who is it?"
// Page MidnighterKidnap5 Text :
"P641190648" "<color orange>Mortimer smiles at you and then his smile falls into a scowl as he snarls forth a name.</color><br><br>"Positron.<br><br>Such a brilliant man has never been such a fool in the history of mankind. He wastes this power, containing it within his lab, ignored or forgotten. It is an unfinished hobby pushed off to the side in favor of more <i>pressing</i> matters. What can be more pressing than to tap into the power of the gods?<br><br>Bah! Fool.""
// Answer Text :
"P72620522" "It sounds like you have no love of the man."
// Page MidnighterKidnap6 Text :
"P2947908420" "<color orange>Mortimer raises his brows in internal debate and then speaks</color><br><br>"Don't get me wrong. Dr. Keyes is a good and pure man, he is just incredibly short sighted, even blinded at times. I cannot stand for those who are blind to their own potential. They are thieves of the human race. Their ignorance and lack of initiative costs us all in the advancement and learning of our species.<br><br>I had plans to retrieve the Flames of Prometheus myself, but it would seem that another, more enterprising individual, is going to beat me to it..."<br><br><color orange>Mortimer Kal looks at you and smirks.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2116114711" "Work with me and we shall both have what we want."
// Page MidnighterKidnap7 Text :
"P927480884" "<color orange>Mortimer nods at your suggestion.</color><br><br>"Ensure my daughter's safe return and I shall assist you in claiming the Flames of Prometheus. She is all that I care for anymore in this world. Do this for me, and the Flames will be yours. This is my promise, this is my vow.""
// Answer Text :
"P76321287" "Agree to the terms (Leave)"
// Page NotMidnighter1 Text :
"P2510487835" "<color orange>Mortimer Kal emits a low grumbling murmer... he's quietly incanting a spell, perhaps in preparation for trouble.</color><br><br>"{HeroName}... What do you want?""
// Answer Text :
"P2718616564" "Your cooperation, in exchange for your daughter."
// Page NotMidnighter2 Text :
"P751125848" "<color orange>The murming stops as Mortimer's eyes widen in instant understanding and then narrow into dangerous slits. Slits that conceal absolute contempt for every fiber of your being.</color><br><br>"... I should have known that <i>you</i> were behind her disappearance.""
// Answer Text :
"P81840782" "Deductions aside, shall we discuss my terms?"
// Page Kidnap1 Text :
"P590712065" "<color orange>Venom coats Mortimer's words as he grudgingly begins negotiations with you.</color><br><br>"Very well, villain. Speak your words and I shall listen. But know this. Should <i>any</i> harm come to my daughter than I shall call upon fell deeds and dark favors from places that even nightmares fear to wander, and you shall wish that you had never heard the name Mortimer Kal.""
// Answer Text :
"P1216593496" "Save your threats, wizard. I know how much she means to you."
// Page Kidnap2 Text :
"P1644524185" "<color orange>Mortimer scowls at you, his presence shrinking at the prospect of losing something he deeply cares about.</color><br><br>"As long as we have an understanding, {HeroName}. Now tell me, what must I do to get my daughter back?"<br><br><color orange>As if suspecting treachery he adds.</color><br><br>"Back alive and unmarred by your villainous reputation. Unmarred in any sense of the word, I might insist.""
// Answer Text :
"P2210599462" "Explain your desire for Incarnate power."
// Page Kidnap3 Text :
"P595473428" "<color orange>Mortimer nods his understanding at your desires and smiles.</color><br><br>"Lucky for my daughter I know of a way, but this is no easy path you set out upon. You will need my help to secure the power you seek."<br><br><color orange>He looks uncomfortable after mentioning that.</color><br><br>"All I ask for in return is my daughter safely returned to me and to never be bothered by you again.""

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3058809241" "If this girl, Fiona, truly is the daughter of Mortimer Kal, then you could use her to gain leverage over the old wizard. With the Circle of Thorns going after her for their own dark purposes you have the perfect opportunity to swoop in and steal the girl, and let blame for her disappearance rest on the Circle."
// AcceptString :
"P2342016835" "Steal Fiona from the Circle of Thorns"
// SendOffString :
"P4197148366" "You'll need to be careful and not just with the Circle of Thorns. Fiona, like her father, has the blood of Mu in her veins. There's no telling how much of that innate magical power she has tapped into. She could be more dangerous than any Circle Mage you've run into yet."
// TaskTitle :
"P4079641687" "<font face=title><scale 1.1><span align=center><color orange>Wizard's Weakness</color></span></scale></font><br><span align=center><color yellow><i>Villain Mission</i></color></span>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1433159555" "<color deepskyblue>Daddy's Girl</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4-7_Mortimer_Kal_SF_Tip_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1835932640" "Kidnap Fiona from the University"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1713014725" "Kidnapping Fiona is not to be undertaken lightly. For all you know her father, Mortimer, has spells cast upon her that will warn him when she is in danger, whisk her away to safety, or simply transform the assailant into a toad. In addition there are the Circle of Thorns who you are going to cross in the process and Fiona herself, who could be a powerful sorceress in her own right.<br><br>You'd better get to the University before the Circle of Thorns take your prize."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2942552622" "The first thing you notice heading into the University basement is the gagging stink of moth eaten linen mixing with the acidic sting of brimstone. The Circle of Thorns is definitely here."
// ExitStringSuccess :
"P3882582627" "After securing Fiona back at your lair you head back to the University and find the place crawling with Midnighters. Mortimer Kal is certain to be worried about his estranged daughter now. The time has come to apply leverage against the old wizard."

